You slash wildly at your target for [125%, 128%, 131%, 134%, 137% (TL1-5; STR 100)] (at 0 Hate) to [185%, 195%, 205%, 215%, 225% (TL1-5; STR 100)] (at 100+ Hate) damage.

At level 3, any wound you inflict with this carries a part of your curse, reducing the effectiveness of healing by [27%, 27%, 27%, 34%, 39% (TL1-5)] for 15 turns. The effect will stack.

The damage multiplier increases with your Strength.

This talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.
